  <metadata>
    <name>D7 West-end scenic drive</name>
    <desc>Stop-sequence GPX: Canhas / Ponta do Sol public base anchor -&gt; Achadas da Cruz upper station -&gt; optional lower station via cable car -&gt; Pedregal trailhead -&gt; Garganta Funda viewpoint -&gt; Ponta do Pargo lighthouse -&gt; return to base. Includes one non-driving optional cable-car branch. Route ID: D7-DRIVE. Notes: Drive sequence with one optional cable-car segment and one short access walk module.</desc>
  </metadata>
